<title>USA: Seagram sells Heidsieck Monopole line.</title>
<headline>Seagram sells Heidsieck Monopole line.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seagram Co Ltd said Tuesday that its unit, Seagram Spirits and Wine Group, has sold the champagne brand Heidsieck Monopole for undisclosed terms.</p>
<p>Heidsieck Monopole was sold to the Vranken Group.</p>
<p>As part of the deal, it has divested assets attributed to Heidsieck Monopole, including brand and commercial operations, inventory and 132 hectares of vineyards.</p>
<p>Last year, Heidsieck Monopole sold about 1.2 million bottles of champagne.</p>
</text>
